pdn-qso - interactive two-way testing over the pdn-soundmodem modems
https://github.com/packet-net/pdn-qso

Copyright (c) 2026 Tom Fanning M0LTE and Packet.NET contributors

This package ships a single self-contained executable that bundles the pdn-qso
code, its .NET dependencies and the .NET runtime.

